  "description": "Step into the shadows of history with Merchant Ledger, a striking blackletter Old English typeface forged from the spirit of gothic tradition. With its dramatic curves, intricate letterforms, and medieval charm, Merchant Ledger exudes the authority and mystique of ancient manuscripts and royal decrees.\nWhether you’re designing book covers, branding an apothecary, crafting vintage-inspired logos, or summoning the vibe of a dark fantasy saga, this font delivers boldness, elegance, and drama in every glyph. Its timeless Old English aesthetic is balanced with modern versatility, making it equally powerful on posters, apparel, album art, or signage.\nLet your work speak in the language of kings, crusaders, and legendary tradesmen.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Step into the shadows of history with Merchant Ledger, a striking blackletter Old English typeface forged from the spirit of gothic tradition. With its dramatic curves, intricate letterforms, and medieval charm, Merchant Ledger exudes the authority and mystique of ancient manuscripts and royal decrees.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re designing book covers, branding an apothecary, crafting vintage-inspired logos, or summoning the vibe of a dark fantasy saga, this font delivers boldness, elegance, and drama in every glyph. Its timeless Old English aesthetic is balanced with modern versatility, making it equally powerful on posters, apparel, album art, or signage.</p>\n<p>Let your work speak in the language of kings, crusaders, and legendary tradesmen.</p>",
